## Development

### Prerequisites

- Python 3.11+
- UV package manager
- Earthly (for builds)
{% if uses_kubernetes %}
- kubectl configured for cluster access
{% endif %}
{% if uses_temporal %}
- Temporal server (or port-forward to cluster)
{% endif %}

### Setup

```bash
# Install dependencies
cd agents/{{ agent_name }}
uv sync

# Run tests
uv run pytest

# Run locally (requires port-forwarding)
{% if uses_temporal %}
kubectl port-forward svc/temporal-frontend 7233:7233 -n temporal &
{% endif %}
{% if uses_llm %}
kubectl port-forward svc/llm-api 8000:8000 -n vllm &
{% endif %}
uv run python -m {{ package_name }}.worker check
```

### Building

```bash
# Build with Earthly
earthly +{{ agent_name }}

# Push to registry
earthly --push +{{ agent_name }}-push
```

## Deployment

### GitOps

Manifests are in `gitops/apps/ai-agents/{{ agent_name }}/`:
- `deployment.yaml` - Worker deployment
- `rbac.yaml` - RBAC permissions
- `kustomization.yaml` - Kustomize config
{% if schedule_type == 'scheduled' %}
- `schedule-job.yaml` - Job to start scheduled workflow
{% endif %}

### Environment Variables

| Variable | Description | Default |
|----------|-------------|---------|
{% if uses_temporal %}
| `TEMPORAL_HOST` | Temporal server address | `temporal-frontend.temporal.svc.cluster.local:7233` |
| `TEMPORAL_NAMESPACE` | Temporal namespace | `default` |
{% endif %}
{% if uses_llm %}
| `VLLM_API_URL` | vLLM API endpoint | `http://llm-api.vllm.svc.cluster.local:8000/v1` |
| `VLLM_MODEL` | Model to use | `openai/gpt-oss-20b` |
{% endif %}
{% if uses_discord %}
| `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` | Discord webhook for notifications | (required) |
{% endif %}

## Architecture

```
{{ package_name }}/
├── worker.py      # Entry point and CLI
├── agent.py       # Strands agent configuration
├── tools.py       # Agent tools (@tool decorated functions)
├── models.py      # Pydantic data models
{% if uses_temporal %}
├── activities.py  # Temporal activities
└── workflows.py   # Temporal workflows
{% endif %}
```

